  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 240°C/220°C fan-forced.\n• Slice pumpkin into thin wedges.\n• Cut red onion and tomato into wedges.\n• Place pumpkin on a lined oven tray, sprinkle over dried oregano (see ingredients), drizzle with olive oil and season with salt. Toss to coat.\n• Roast until tender, 20-25 minutes.\n• TIP: Peel the pumpkin if you prefer!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/686f3e2469ddbf20131a9bbc/step-acb7cd00.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Place red onion and tomato on a second lined oven tray.\n• Drizzle with olive oil and season with salt. Toss to coat. Roast until tender, 15-20 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/686f3e2469ddbf20131a9bbc/step-83ce6a10.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• While veggies are roasting, thinly slice leek.\n• Roughly chop silverbeet.\n• Finely chop garlic.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/686f3e2469ddbf20131a9bbc/step-57252d20.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large saucepan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat.\n• Cook leek, stirring, until softened, 4-5 minutes.\n• Add silverbeet, Nan’s special seasoning and garlic and cook until fragrant, 1 minute.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/686f3e2469ddbf20131a9bbc/step-c405c530.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• To the pan, stir in risoni, stock concentrate, light cooking cream and the water. Bring to the boil, then reduce heat to medium and simmer, stirring occasionally, until the risoni is ‘al dente’ and the water is absorbed, 12-15 minutes.\n• Gently stir roast veggies through the risoni.\n• TIP: Add a splash more water if the risoni looks dry!\n• TIP: ‘Al dente’ pasta is cooked through but still slightly firm in the centre.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/686f3e2469ddbf20131a9bbc/step-b75c3640.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide creamy leek risoni between bowls.\n• Top with oregano pumpkin. Drizzle the honey over the pumpkin.\n• Crumble over fetta cubes to serve. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/686f3e2469ddbf20131a9bbc/step-0e8e7750.jpg"
    }
  ]
